      The dark theme's canvas and ink, matching the canvas and ink tokens under
      data-appearance="dark" in apps/web/src/styles.css. Without them the window,
      the loading screen and the WebView's own background stayed #FBFAF7, so a
      dark-mode phone flashed a light screen before the dark page arrived (A8).
    -->
